    "detailed_description": "Pipe Escape is a tight controlled 2D puzzle game where the only objective is to escape a labyrinth of pipes whilst in a constant state of spin. <br><br>Work with the spin, not against it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/3071c58e9f20317215975fdf429c0da4.poster.avif?t=1744763316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/3071c58e9f20317215975fdf429c0da4.webm?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/3071c58e9f20317215975fdf429c0da4.mp4?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Encounter the challenges that await in the maze of leaky pipes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/e57e115c4c91ba3ee91f0601c95fbc26.poster.avif?t=1744763316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/e57e115c4c91ba3ee91f0601c95fbc26.webm?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/e57e115c4c91ba3ee91f0601c95fbc26.mp4?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The pipes are inhabited by bats and you are not welcome. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/7914f5bb896eaa56a602ae453aa3223f.poster.avif?t=1744763316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/7914f5bb896eaa56a602ae453aa3223f.webm?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/7914f5bb896eaa56a602ae453aa3223f.mp4?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find your way to an exit through the depths of this pipe hell!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/cb0aa3721c24981c0a04fe403929a29d.poster.avif?t=1744763316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/cb0aa3721c24981c0a04fe403929a29d.webm?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/cb0aa3721c24981c0a04fe403929a29d.mp4?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Pipe Escape is a tight controlled 2D puzzle game where the only objective is to escape a labyrinth of pipes whilst in a constant state of spin. <br><br>Work with the spin, not against it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/3071c58e9f20317215975fdf429c0da4.poster.avif?t=1744763316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/3071c58e9f20317215975fdf429c0da4.webm?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/3071c58e9f20317215975fdf429c0da4.mp4?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Encounter the challenges that await in the maze of leaky pipes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/e57e115c4c91ba3ee91f0601c95fbc26.poster.avif?t=1744763316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/e57e115c4c91ba3ee91f0601c95fbc26.webm?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/e57e115c4c91ba3ee91f0601c95fbc26.mp4?t=1744763316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The pipes are inhabited by bats and you are not welcome. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/7914f5bb896eaa56a602ae453aa3223f.poster.avif?t=1744763316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835410/extras/7914f5bb896eaa56a602ae453aa3223f.webm?t